      "detail": "https://www.sturbridge.gov/home/events/166186",
      "quote": "Consideration and possible action on the posting of a Dual Warrant for the Town Election on April 14, 2025 and Annual & Special Town Meeting of April 28, 2025",
      "note": "HONEST GRADE: this is the town scheduling its own election, not reporting one held. It is a Sturbridge Select Board agenda on the town own domain, the same grade of evidence as the Clarksburg warrant, and no source found says the day was later moved. Two independent supports: Sturbridge votes on a Monday, its 2024 annual report prints OFFICIAL ANNUAL TOWN ELECTION RESULTS Monday, April 08, 2024 and 2026 is Monday April 13, and April 14 2025 was a Monday. The return we hold prints no date, which is why the gate could not date it."
    }
